{"1609130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "WORLD EATER", "steam_appid": 1609130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESTRUCTION IS UPON US</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORLD EATER</strong> is a bossfight game about an underpaid astronaut fighting a giant worm in space. You are a regular crystal mining employee for<i> the company</i>, who has tasked you with a seamingly easy endeavor. One of their worms has discovered a magical resource called<strong> space dust</strong>, which has some interesting side effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out on a mission that is most definitely not stated in your contract and defeat the world eating worm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show em' how it's done. Run, fly, dodge and smack your way through this epic space bossfight against the colossal, solar system eating worm!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the vast, beautiful space environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, fly and dodge on interesting and ever-changing planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through several environments while the<strong> WORLD EATER</strong> tries to stop you</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT'S NEXT?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a small team of 4 developers who have been working at improving the current state of the game. We are planning on creating a lot more content with new and interesting mechanics and environments. We hope you join us in our journey in making our student project a full-fledged game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DESTRUCTION IS UPON US</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORLD EATER</strong> is a bossfight game about an underpaid astronaut fighting a giant worm in space. You are a regular crystal mining employee for<i> the company</i>, who has tasked you with a seamingly easy endeavor. One of their worms has discovered a magical resource called<strong> space dust</strong>, which has some interesting side effects. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set out on a mission that is most definitely not stated in your contract and defeat the world eating worm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show em' how it's done. Run, fly, dodge and smack your way through this epic space bossfight against the colossal, solar system eating worm!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the vast, beautiful space environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, fly and dodge on interesting and ever-changing planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through several environments while the<strong> WORLD EATER</strong> tries to stop you</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT'S NEXT?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a small team of 4 developers who have been working at improving the current state of the game. We are planning on creating a lot more content with new and interesting mechanics and environments. We hope you join us in our journey in making our student project a full-fledged game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "WORLD EATER is a bossfight game about an underpaid astronaut fighting a giant worm in space. Fight your way through varying planets and defeat the colossal worm!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609130/header.jpg?t=1748623286", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609130/dac0116e25a2d9396c624bc97c6e2a57c25f3fde/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748623286", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1609130/dac0116e25a2d9396c624bc97c6e2a57c25f3fde/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748623286", "website": "https://sanforgestudio.com/pro